				<title>Play videoclip for currently playing song in mpv</title>
				<link>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2018/03/29/get-song-title-from-dbus-via-mpris2-find-videoclip-with-ddgr-on-youtube-and-play-it-with-mpv/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 29 Mar 2018 15:15:14 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2018/03/29/get-song-title-from-dbus-via-mpris2-find-videoclip-with-ddgr-on-youtube-and-play-it-with-mpv/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Short demo:&#xA;&lt;video width=&#34;100%&#34; autoplay loop itemscope itemtype=&#34;http://schema.org/VideoObject&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source src=&#34;../mpd2mpv.mp4&#34; type=&#34;video/webm&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    Your browser does not support the video tag.&#xA;&lt;/video&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You&amp;rsquo;ll need:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;python 3.x&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mpv.io/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpv&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; video player&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;music player that supports &lt;a href=&#34;https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;MPRIS2 D-Bus interface&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.musicpd.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpd&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; + &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/eonpatapon/mpDris2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpDris2&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://deadbeef.sourceforge.net/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;deadbeef&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; + &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Serranya/deadbeef-mpris2-plugin&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpris2-plugin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;some &lt;code&gt;D-Bus&lt;/code&gt; packages -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;dbus-devel dbus-python-devel dbus-glib-devel&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;&#34;&gt;ddgr&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/jarun/ddgr&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/jarun/ddgr&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; - a CLI client for &lt;code&gt;DuckDuckGo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&